OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA bright
OL,6,Fevening in the south. Rather cloudy in
OL,7,Fthe north, with further patchy rain,
OL,8,Fwhich could be heavy across northern
OL,9,FEngland for a time. Mostly cloudy
OL,10,Fovernight, with further rain and
OL,11,Fdrizzle in the north and west.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FRemaining cloudy in the north
OL,14,Fwith outbreaks of rain, turning
OL,15,Fheavier and more persistent later.
OL,16,FFurther south, hazy sunshine will
OL,17,Fdevelop, making it feel very warm and
OL,18,Fhumid.
